# Optional accounts (Supabase). Copy to .env.local and fill in both to turn accounts on in
# development; leave them empty and accounts are off. Both values are public (the anon key is
# meant for browsers). Never put the service-role key here. See supabase/README.md.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
